{"id":"5caa540e2aeaaba6","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_FEncodeFormula.md","title":"FEncodeFormula","display":"FEncodeFormula","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"FEncodeFormula","parameters":["E","F","R","f","r","g","t","u"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"FEncodeFormula"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>E</span><span>F</span><span>R</span><span>f</span><span>r</span><span>g</span><span>t</span><span>u</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：一阶 alpha 编码。有序参数：<code>E</code>、<code>F</code>、<code>R</code>、<code>f</code>、<code>r</code>、<code>g</code>、<code>t</code>、<code>u</code>。</p>\n<p>消去绑定名，不消去自由名字区别。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ FEncodeFormula E F R f r g t u)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(exists z4922 (@ FEncodeFormulaProof E F R f r g t u z4922))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5ae4a3ef898cf8f2\" href=\"?note=5ae4a3ef898cf8f2\" title=\"ZFC_FEncodeFormulaProof\">FEncodeFormulaProof</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1",